userData/
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
# LanceDB vector store
*.lance/

# ── Temporary files ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
tmp/
temp/
.tmp/
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej

# ── AI tool — personal/machine-specific state ─────────────────────────────────
# Aider conversation history (personal — not shared)
.aider.chat.history.md
.aider.input.history
# Cursor personal workspace config
.cursor/mcp.json
# Continue.dev session cache
.continue/.sessions/
# rtk (token-saver CLI) local command-history DB — written at runtime in cwd
/rtk/

# Claude Code — the agent system (.claude/agents, skills, commands, hooks,
# review-routes.json, settings.json) IS committed; personal/transient files are NOT:
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/memory/
.claude/.review-cache
.claude/.review-metrics.jsonl
.claude/.review-ledger.jsonl
.claude/.review-cooldown.json
.claude/*.bak-ruflo
.claude-flow*
# Per-task handoff files are transient; the template is committed.
.claude/scratch/*
!.claude/scratch/HANDOFF_TEMPLATE.md
# Local git worktrees used for parallel agent work — never committed.
.claude/worktrees/
# Impeccable plugin hook cache — machine-local absolute paths, never committed.
.impeccable/

# NOTE: Project-level AI instruction files ARE committed (not ignored):
#   AGENTS.md  → CANONICAL rules; read natively by Cursor, Windsurf, Codex et al.
#                (Copilot too, but not in every feature — hence its pointer below)
#   CLAUDE.md  → Claude Code: imports @AGENTS.md, adds Claude-only orchestration
#   Thin pointers to AGENTS.md — for tools that don't read it natively, don't read it in
#   full, or where an explicit pointer is cheap insurance (Codex reads it natively):
#     .clinerules → Cline · .github/copilot-instructions.md → GitHub Copilot
#     .codexrules → Codex · .roorules → Roo · .jba/guidelines.md → JetBrains AI
#     .aider/system-prompt.md → Aider (settings live in .aider.conf.yml)
#   Never fork rules into these — `pnpm check:agent-system` caps pointers at 1KB
#   (.aider.conf.yml is exempt: real settings, not rules).

# ── Misc ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.pid
*.pid.lock
*.seed
CHANGELOG.md

.profraw
.cargo
target/llvm-cov/
.mcp.json
graphify-out/
.codegraph/
.obsidian/

post-checkout
post-commit

CLAUDE.local.md
docs/NEXT_ISSUES.md

# /world video clips are served from Cloudflare R2 behind cdn.aijobhunter.app,
# not from git. See apps/landing/src/app/world/world-config.ts, which is the
# authority (an earlier plan to ship them as `world-assets-vN` release assets was
# abandoned: scrub-engine.js loads each clip with fetch().blob(), and GitHub
# release downloads send no Access-Control-Allow-Origin). A local copy is fine.
apps/landing/public/world/vid/

# Growth charts fetched from the orphan `badges` branch at deploy time
# (.github/workflows/pages.yml). ~77 KB that changes every day, so committing
# them would add ~28 MB of git history a year — the cost the parentless badges
# branch exists to avoid. Same rule as the /world clips above: build-time
# asset, never a commit.
apps/landing/public/stars.svg
apps/landing/public/downloads.svg

# ── Generated image sets ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# All rendered output, not source: every file below is produced by a committed
# generator, and each regeneration used to write another few MB into history that
# no clone needs but every clone pays for. Rendered copies are archived on the
# `assets-v1` release; the résumé showcase banner the README embeds lives on the
# parentless `assets` branch instead, because a release asset is served as
# application/octet-stream with Content-Disposition: attachment and will not
# render in a README. Same rule as the /world clips and the growth charts above.
#
# NOTE none of this shrinks .git on its own — the old blobs stay in history until
# a rewrite. It stops the growth; it does not undo it.

# node branding/marketing/build.mjs  (icon-512.png is an INPUT — it stays)
branding/marketing/*.png
!branding/marketing/icon-512.png

# node apps/extension/scripts/gen-store-assets.mjs
apps/extension/store-assets/screenshots/
apps/extension/store-assets/promo/

# cargo test generate_templates_showcase_banner (typst_engine/test.rs)
# Published to the `assets` branch — see docs/EXPORT_TEMPLATES.md.
docs/assets/templates-showcase.png
